  "post_content": "<p style=\"border: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 18px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(97, 97, 97); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, Tahoma, san-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 23.399999618530273px; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">La III Semana Cultural de Onda&nbsp;ha dado la tarde de este martes paso a la literatura como principal protagonista. La escritora y periodista valenciana Carmen Amoraga Toledo, premio Nadal 2014,&nbsp;ha sido la invitada este a&ntilde;o para ofrecer una conferencia en torno a su experiencia como narradora.</span></span></p><div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/conferenciacarmenamoragasetmanaculturalonda/img_0127.jpg\" alt=\"img_0127\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/conferenciacarmenamoragasetmanaculturalonda/img_0129.jpg\" alt=\"img_0129\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/conferenciacarmenamoragasetmanaculturalonda/img_0130.jpg\" alt=\"img_0130\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/conferenciacarmenamoragasetmanaculturalonda/img_0132.jpg\" alt=\"img_0132\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/conferenciacarmenamoragasetmanaculturalonda/img_0134.jpg\" alt=\"img_0134\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/conferenciacarmenamoragasetmanaculturalonda/img_0135.jpg\" alt=\"img_0135\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/conferenciacarmenamoragasetmanaculturalonda/img_0136.jpg\" alt=\"img_0136\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img 